Title:
Fabric Workspace Provisioner — Web Application Development & Service Principal Integration

Type: User Story / Task

Description:
Developed a Flask-based web application to automate the new partner onboarding process in Microsoft Fabric. The application connects to the Fabric REST API and WH_MetaData warehouse using the P_AGS_ANALYTICS service principal (Azure Entra App).

Work Completed:

Built Flask web application with end-to-end provisioning flow
Integrated Service Principal (Azure Entra App) authentication using MSAL
Connected application to WH_MetaData warehouse — loads 34 table definitions on connect
Implemented 5-step provisioning: Create Workspace → Assign Capacity → Add Admin → Create Warehouse → Insert Metadata (PartnerMaster + ConfigMaster)
Added rollback logic — deletes workspace if any step fails
Tested connection and metadata retrieval successfully

In Progress:

Updating code to support existing workspaces (2.2 scope) — current environment does not have permissions to create new workspaces

Acceptance Criteria:

 App authenticates via Service Principal without user intervention
 App connects to WH_MetaData and reads TableDefinition
 Provisioning flow completes end-to-end for new partners
 Existing workspace support implemented and tested
